Thu muc chua firmware de robot tai qua WiFi.

Quy trinh phat hanh:
  1. Tang set(PROJECT_VER "...") trong xiaozhi-esp32/CMakeLists.txt
  2. idf.py build
  3. cp ../xiaozhi-esp32/build/xiaozhi.bin firmware/
  4. fly deploy

File .bin KHONG commit vao git (xem .gitignore) — 2,5MB moi ban se phinh repo.
Server tu doc phien ban va ma chip tu chinh file nen khong co tep phu nao de lech.
